<title>SINGAPORE: BASF Asia unit opens technical centre.</title>
<headline>BASF Asia unit opens technical centre.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BASF AG said its Asian unit BASF Textile and Leather Centre had inaugurated a US$6 million technical centre in the Malaysian state of Johor, just north of Singapore's border, on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The centre will be served by a team of research chemists and technologists and provide support to BASF's textile and leather dyes and chemicals operations in Asia, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
